<section image-layout="blank" id="ZEMMote33n"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="vdCB7DPQsK" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 20pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">TRANSITION</p><p role="caption">10 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="ZWjPsmm7y_" padding="12pt 24pt 18pt 28pt" colspan="53"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">30 days to accepted ownership—not memory transfer</h2><p font-size="16pt">T+0 is formal handover acceptance; all later markers are relative.</p><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="HLheB-SP6g" padding="0" colspan="60"><table col-widths="[8,24,68]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 3pt 7pt;"><tbody><tr><th>When</th><th>Owner</th><th>Required result</th></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><b>T+1</b></td><td>Incoming PM</td><td>Confirm owners/deputies, artifact locations, invites, and access.</td></tr><tr><td><b>T+3</b></td><td>Incoming PM</td><td>Walk the system path, reconcile delivery board, and log contradictions.</td></tr><tr><td background-color="surface"><b>T+5</b></td><td>Data + Operations</td><td>Complete A-06 benchmark, training, and rollback rehearsal.</td></tr><tr><td background-color="surface"><b>T+6</b></td><td>Product Owner</td><td>Decide D-04 from benchmark evidence; record the consequence.</td></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-3"><b>T+10</b></td><td>Product Owner + PM</td><td>Review tests, roles, fallback, and authority; accept or extend.</td></tr><tr><td><b>T+15</b></td><td>Technical + Operations</td><td>Run the first rollout only when entry criteria are met.</td></tr><tr><td><b>T+30</b></td><td>Product Owner + PM</td><td>Review stability, adoption, open risks, and temporary controls.</td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item><grid-item id="_WrNMjuwyS" background-color="surface" padding="8pt 10pt" colspan="60"><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="uofO3hxRCu" colspan="18"><p role="eyebrow">Acceptance test</p><h3 font-size="20pt">Proceed without the author?</h3><p font-size="15pt">Turn private-memory dependencies into documented actions.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="OiZWo3R4KV" colspan="42"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="o23ZChirBL" colspan="30"><todo>Access authoritative artifacts plus production and reporting systems.</todo></grid-item><grid-item id="sD4kFMBeop" colspan="30"><todo>Locate evidence for status, risks, and D-04.</todo></grid-item><grid-item id="jVOlk340ZT" colspan="30"><todo>Name decision authority and explain rollback.</todo></grid-item><grid-item id="FfvAtF1QV0" colspan="30"><todo>State the next three actions without help.</todo></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>